<Base title="About Us">
  <section class="about-page">
    <h1>About AI Trading Tools</h1>
    
    <p>We are a team of traders and software engineers who believe AI is transforming how retail investors analyze markets — but most tools are overpriced and overhyped.</p>

    <p>Our mission: <strong>test every AI trading tool on the market and tell you which ones actually work.</strong></p>

    <h2>How We Review</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Hands-on testing:</strong> We use every tool ourselves for at least 2 weeks before reviewing.</li>
      <li><strong>No pay-for-play:</strong> We never accept payment for positive reviews. Some links are affiliate links, but our opinions are our own.</li>
      <li><strong>Retail trader perspective:</strong> We judge tools by whether they help individual traders, not institutions.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This does not influence our reviews — we only recommend tools we genuinely believe in.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
